OL,3,AWe can't afford to hire under-25s, say
OL,4,Afirms. Will Milburn plans help?
OL,5,
OL,6,FLowering employers' National Insurance
OL,7,F(NI) payments for those between 21 and
OL,8,F24, and cash incentives to take on some
OL,9,Fworkers are among proposals put forward
OL,10,Fin Alan Milburn's report to get more
OL,11,F18-24 year-olds working.
OL,13,FMany companies have complained that
OL,14,Frecent increases in National Insurance
OL,15,Fand the minimum wage have made it more
OL,16,Fexpensive to take on staff.
OL,18,FWe talked to firms and business groups
OL,19,Fabout the issues they face when hiring
OL,20,Fyounger works and what they make of the
OL,21,Fproposals.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
