OL,3,AWe can't afford to hire under-25s, say
OL,4,Afirms. Will Milburn plans help?
OL,5,
OL,6,FCutting NI costs is "right in the sweet
OL,7,Fspot of what firms need to hit the hire
OL,8,Fbutton", said the Recruitment and
OL,9,FEmployment Confederation (REC).
